<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Static sitemap for the v2 public portal.

  WHY THE ORIGIN IS HARDCODED (and why this is a static file, not @astrojs/sitemap)
  @astrojs/sitemap is NOT a dependency of this project, so we ship a plain static
  sitemap under public/ instead. Files under public/ are served verbatim; Astro
  does not template them, so each <loc> cannot be built from PUBLIC_SITE_URL at
  request time. We therefore hardcode the production canonical origin, which
  matches PUBLIC_SITE_URL's production default (see src/config.js DEFAULTS).
  If the custom domain ever changes, update this file AND public/robots.txt.

  Lists every real page the redesign ships. lastmod is a fixed build-era date
  (mirrors the old build.mjs approach); bump it when page content changes.
-->
